\item{\code{files}}{object[]; never \code{NA}. One per input, in input order: the per-file block (path, file_type, reader, record_type, views, skipped_count, skipped, record_count, rows_not_read, retention_time_unit, caveats, column_names, absent_fields, failed_fields, excluded_fields, error). An unread input has error set and every fact it could not establish null or empty.}
